  "description": "Strange things have been happening to Lee Yuan lately. Fainting spells, waking up with strangers in his bed, lost memories…for someone who wants to live an uneventful life, he sure has been busy lately. That’s when his friend Do-Yoon makes a confession: though he may look normal, Do-Yoon is in fact a reaper sent to earth to retrieve a ghost who refuses to move on. And just who should that ghost be possessing? You guessed it! The only way to send a spirit up to the afterlife is to satisfy its needs, and Do-Yoon is determined to suck the spirit right out of Yuan in more way than one…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
